    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39025" root="موث" body-key="m">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انماث</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْمِيَاثٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was
steeped in water, and mashed with the hand:</i> (TA:)
<i>it was mixed and moistened</i> in water. (S, K.)
[See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ميث</span>.] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاثَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمُوثُ</span>, is also
[thus] used intransitively. (Msb.)

